WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.083
(instrumental music)

00:00:09.393 --> 00:00:10.226
- [Voiceover] Everyone always

00:00:10.226 --> 00:00:13.935
has these grand aspirations about life.

00:00:13.935 --> 00:00:17.158
When I grow up, I'm gonna do this.

00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:19.040
Be this person.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.634
I'm gonna make a name for myself.

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.558
I'm gonna be someone.

00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:26.391
You know, always these big dreams.

00:00:28.582 --> 00:00:29.832
I was the same.

00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:35.089
I wanted that big job, that
big house, that fast car.

00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:37.865
All of it.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.797
Didn't get it, though.

00:00:41.797 --> 00:00:43.047
Not even close.

00:00:45.932 --> 00:00:48.078
I ended up here instead.

00:00:48.078 --> 00:00:49.995
37 years at this place.

00:00:51.596 --> 00:00:53.846
God, has it been that long?

00:00:56.173 --> 00:00:57.378
First two years I told myself

00:00:57.378 --> 00:01:00.153
it was gonna be a temporary thing.

00:01:00.153 --> 00:01:03.486
I was gonna move on, get that big house.

00:01:04.553 --> 00:01:07.143
It was only for the paycheck.

00:01:07.143 --> 00:01:10.891
Supposed to help the
wife and feed the baby.

00:01:10.891 --> 00:01:14.428
But then baby number two came and well,

00:01:14.428 --> 00:01:18.595
two years turned into five
and five years turned into 10.

00:01:20.484 --> 00:01:23.177
It's funny how things change.

00:01:23.177 --> 00:01:25.751
How your perspective changes.

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:27.152
You grow up.

00:01:27.152 --> 00:01:30.054
You get married and have kids.

00:01:30.054 --> 00:01:31.660
You learn that a lot
of stuff they told you

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:34.993
when you were younger was just bullshit.

00:01:36.377 --> 00:01:39.695
Life's always been about
lessons and moments.

00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:41.228
That's all life is.

00:01:41.228 --> 00:01:43.868
Just a series of moments.

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:46.868
Not things, not wants or even needs,

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:51.500
just simple, honest to God moments

00:01:53.132 --> 00:01:54.909
that hopefully add up to you living

00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:58.298
a decent life and being a good person.

00:01:58.298 --> 00:01:59.823
Really, it's always been little moments

00:01:59.823 --> 00:02:04.186
that you remember over
everything else anyways.

00:02:04.186 --> 00:02:06.386
The smile of a loved one,

00:02:06.386 --> 00:02:09.301
the sound of their voice in the morning.

00:02:09.301 --> 00:02:12.793
How easy their hand fit into yours.

00:02:12.793 --> 00:02:15.075
I didn't plan on ending up at this desk.

00:02:15.075 --> 00:02:17.672
But it was where life took me.

00:02:17.672 --> 00:02:19.313
I didn't get the dream.

00:02:19.313 --> 00:02:21.485
I got a life instead.

00:02:21.485 --> 00:02:25.402
And it was more than I
could've ever asked for.

